A little low maybe for the endgame (air elementals) and Rodney.  
However, in Gehennom you may stumble over quite some potions of 
full healing (assuming you can kill the owners fast enough), 
so you could fix this if you plan to spend some time in there.  
If you don't (see below), you could polypile potions and 
utilize alchemy to get some 100 more.  Or just go with the 
196 and have full healing at hand anytime (a little more 
risky maybe, but gives more bragging rights..).  

> Blessed potions got me most of the HP and Pw that I have.  How
