> For eq (listed below) I have a t-shirt, SDSM, CoMR, HoB, SBoots,
> WWBoots, GoD, & GoP all enchanted up to give me an AC of -39.
> Seems pretty good.

The Eye of the Aethiopica confers magic resistance, hence no 
need for the cloak anymore.  You can ditch it in favour of, 
say, a cloak of displacement or a robe.  

> I had an "oLS, but used it up discovering that WWBoots weren't
> enough on Medusa.  Currently wearing "oMB with the Eye in my
> inventory.

I'd rather wear ESP so you can see and avoid those krakens.  
(You might utilize warning for this as well, of course).  
"oMB has the slight disadvantage that, if you're on a level 
with teleport and accidentally hit a pool, you don't try 
to teleport away and your stuff gets wet.  But maybe that's 
a matter of taste, and since I only got drowned once in my 
nethack history (IIRC), I may be biased.  

